sioned policy,\nand the 101st request in a window under a limit of 100 is denied with a stable\nreason and matching decision telemetry.\n\nEvidence: tests/fixtures/toolkit/blueprint.md at\nsha256 f40ed16c2898b8363dfce1c19e7c3fd539d52810d52b21faeaf59323117af445,\ncaptured 2026-09-16. The file states it is fixture input and explicitly not\ndocumentation of shipped behavior, so it evidences the intended steel thread\norder and the scope boundaries, not any current implementation.\n\nConstraints:\n- Provider-owned usage metering stays out of scope. This initiative does not\n  read, write, reconcile, or re-implement provider metering, and enforcement\n  counters must not be sourced from it.\n- Production storage and deployment infrastructure are not selected here.\n\nOwner: not recorded in the evidence source. Unresolved.\n\nUnknowns:\n- Responsible owner for each seam and swimlane.\n- Counter storage substrate for window accounting.\n- Fixed versus sliding window semantics.\n- Policy resolution precedence when several policies match one organization.\n- Implementation language and test runner; this repository contains no source\n  tree or harness, so proposed eval commands are unproven.\n"}}],"terminal_reason":"hook_stopped","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":22,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"","ttft_ms":1484,"type":"result","duration_ms":156731,"uuid":"eb992287-303a-48e6-85dd-5ed16d5c0390","ttft_stream_ms":1031,"time_to_request_ms":260,"first_content_frame_ms":1031,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
